# Reference only — this is what a CLIENT of this binhost puts in
# /etc/portage/binrepos.conf (scripts/60-binhost.sh writes it for
# profiles with BINHOST_ROLE=client).
# Replace the host with the PC's Tailscale MagicDNS name or LAN address.

[pc-binhost]
priority = 10
sync-uri = http://pc.tail-example.ts.net/binhost
